1
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:03,770
It's the 3rd day of the tournament.

2
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:09,670
All teams have played their first matches and are starting their second.

3
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,320
I'm shooting!

4
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,290
Matsuoka MS is moving into Hirado's half.

5
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:14,570
I won't allow it.

6
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:17,080
Jito from Hirado is coming to stop them.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:20,330
He's going like a truck that's lost control.

8
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:21,870
To the left!

9
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:24,920
I said I won't allow it.

10
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,390
No, they can't get through.

11
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,130
Jito clears the ball.

12
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,880
Hirado's defense is rock solid.

13
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,880
Hirado hasn't conceded a single goal in this tournament yet.

14
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,730
That's nothing.

15
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:40,140
We won't show our true strength until we play Nankatsu.

16
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:43,520
The first match of the day is starting at Saitama World Stadium.

17
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:51,110
The second match will be between Hanawa MS from Akita and Sakimoto MS from Yamanashi.

18
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:53,360
Alright! The ball is with the twins!

19
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:56,700
Show us some proper football this time.

20
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:57,820
Kardo!

21
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,080
Alright!

22
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:01,370
Older brother Masao Tachibana, who is marked,

23
00:01:01,370 --> 00:01:04,090
passes the ball to Kazuo on the opposite side.

24
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:05,160
I won't allow it!

25
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,960
No! The pass wasn't meant for him!

26
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:09,530
The pass was for Ono! Lobbing it over Kazuo...

27
00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:10,290
Go!

28
00:01:11,370 --> 00:01:12,840
Goal!

29
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,420
Hanawa's 2nd goal!

30
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:19,140
Hanawa may not have shown the twins' full power today,

31
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:21,140
but these goals have sealed the outcome of the match.

32
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:24,200
It seems they are saving their aerial football system for later.

33
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:27,400
Damn it! They won't show us what they've got, huh?

34
00:01:28,650 --> 00:01:31,900
I'm very curious who their next match will be against.

35
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:34,530
Alright! We did it!

36
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:36,610
The final whistle has blown!

37
00:01:36,610 --> 00:01:38,100
Score: 2-0.

38
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:40,620
Hanawa has qualified for the third round!

39
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:46,000
Their next match will be against the winner of the match between Nankatsu and Nishikigaoka.

40
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:48,540
Alright, now it's our turn.

41
00:01:48,540 --> 00:01:50,000
Yes, coach!

