80
00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:25,390
EPISODE 37:
SKYLAB HURRICANE!

81
00:03:20,970 --> 00:03:23,970
Players from both teams are taking their places on the field.

82
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:25,720
This is today's second

83
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:30,980
match, which will be between Shizuoka's representative Nankatsu and Kanagawa's representative Nishigaoka.

84
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:35,070
As you know, with their captain Tsubasa,

85
00:03:35,070 --> 00:03:40,030
they haven't let anyone else take the championship for two years.

86
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:45,700
Their opponents, Nishikigaoka, defeated Kochi's representative Ozusan 3-1

87
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:47,450
and are on a winning streak.

88
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:50,790
Can Nishikigaoka overthrow Nankatsu's throne?

89
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:54,290
Watch and study for tomorrow's match.

90
00:03:54,290 --> 00:03:55,810
Tsubasa!

91
00:03:55,810 --> 00:03:58,420
Keep scoring goals today too!

92
00:04:03,530 --> 00:04:05,140
Tsubasa...

93
00:04:07,730 --> 00:04:09,600
Okay, we made it in time.

94
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,850
The match will start with Nankatsu's kickoff.

95
00:04:11,850 --> 00:04:13,480
Alright, let's do this!

96
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,560
Here it comes!

97
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:22,330
Tsubasa, your leg is still injured.

98
00:04:22,330 --> 00:04:24,950
You focus on resting today!

99
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:26,320
You heard him!

100
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:29,180
If things get serious, you'll step in.

101
00:04:29,790 --> 00:04:31,120
Let's go, guys!

102
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,120
Yeah!

103
00:04:33,350 --> 00:04:38,360
It looks like Nankatsu will attack with Izawa as playmaker, not Tsubasa.

104
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:41,380
What? Tsubasa isn't attacking?

105
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:43,510
Damn it! They're underestimating us!

106
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:47,600
You're the one underestimating us, thinking Nankatsu is only about Tsubasa.

107
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:52,870
Izawa beats one and sends a long pass.

108
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:53,560
Take this!

109
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,730
Nagano crosses the ball to the opposite side.

110
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,540
The ball goes to Taki.

111
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,850
Will Taki dribble like he loves to do?

112
00:05:00,850 --> 00:05:02,280
To you, Izawa!

113
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:04,530
No, he passes to the midfield!

114
00:05:04,530 --> 00:05:06,110
Look at this. This is your end.

115
00:05:06,110 --> 00:05:07,090
Kisugi!

116
00:05:07,090 --> 00:05:09,740
Izawa successfully sends the ball into the penalty area!

117
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:12,870
Kisugi, who ran there on time, catches the ball!

118
00:05:13,770 --> 00:05:15,110
Goal!

119
00:05:15,110 --> 00:05:17,080
Nankatsu scores an incredible goal!

120
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:19,060
Alright!

121
00:05:17,610 --> 00:05:21,710
Taki, Izawa, and Kisugi formed a perfect combination.

122
00:05:23,590 --> 00:05:26,190
You did it! The Former-Shutetsu Trio!

123
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:28,760
Good going, Taki! Izawa! Kisugi!

124
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,810
Guys...

125
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:35,520
Alright!

126
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:37,280
Do you think I'll let you pass?

127
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,850
Ishizaki clears the ball!

128
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:42,070
Nankatsu's defense seems to be working hard too.

129
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:44,410
Everyone looks to be in form.

130
00:05:44,410 --> 00:05:46,820
They're doing their best for Tsubasa.

131
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:48,320
Okay, run!

132
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:50,910
Get back!

133
00:05:50,910 --> 00:05:52,580
Nankatsu is attacking once again!

134
00:05:52,970 --> 00:05:54,830
Nishikigaoka is trying to get back!

135
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,960
Alright!

136
00:05:58,550 --> 00:05:59,990
The ball is in the net!

137
00:05:59,990 --> 00:06:04,380
A brilliant long shot from Izawa.

138
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:05,460
I did it!

139
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:08,560
Damn it! Nankatsu is playing without Tsubasa!

140
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,110
But they're still very strong.

141
00:06:10,110 --> 00:06:14,600
Even without Tsubasa, all the remaining players have both defensive and offensive power.

142
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:17,170
Nankatsu is as good a team as we expected.

143
00:06:17,170 --> 00:06:20,350
They show no weaknesses.

144
00:06:20,350 --> 00:06:22,970
Since they've been called the favorites for the championship,

145
00:06:22,970 --> 00:06:25,860
all eyes are on us, especially on Tsubasa.

146
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:28,340
There's no point in hiding our power anymore.

147
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:30,870
Come on, let's show what we can do.

148
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:39,290
Even though we've kept our new special move to pressure Nankatsu a secret until now,

149
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:45,420
they are now trying to show all their strength and pressure us.

150
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,420
Take this, Taki!

151
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:48,220
Of course!

152
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:50,590
Nankatsu doesn't hold back when they attack!

153
00:06:50,590 --> 00:06:52,590
Will they score their 3rd goal?

154
00:06:52,590 --> 00:06:54,430
What?

155
00:06:55,090 --> 00:06:56,310
Tsubasa...

156
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:58,100
Take this!

157
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,290
Goal!

158
00:07:00,290 --> 00:07:03,400
Scoring the 3rd goal, Tsubasa from Nankatsu!

159
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,940
Tsubasa!

160
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:09,470
If I rest too much, I'll get lazy.

161
00:07:09,470 --> 00:07:11,320
At least let me do this much.

162
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,930
Pile on him!

163
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:14,950
We said it's fine for you to stay back and rest!

164
00:07:14,950 --> 00:07:17,240
Well, after all, you're the captain.

165
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,250
That's our Tsubasa!

166
00:07:19,250 --> 00:07:20,560
So cool!

167
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:23,330
Kumi, you're only watching Tsubasa, aren't you?

168
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:25,330
Tsubasa...

169
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:29,670
The match ends with the whistle.

170
00:07:29,670 --> 00:07:31,070
6-0!

171
00:07:31,070 --> 00:07:33,760
Nankatsu shows its strength as the undefeated champion.

172
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,460
They advance to the third round.

173
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:37,950
They're really strong.

174
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:40,020
We're no match for them.

175
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:43,270
Alright! The next team is Hanawa!

176
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:45,980
Just wait, Tachibana Twins!

177
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:47,810
You're really strong, Nankatsu...

178
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:49,740
So are we!

179
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:53,570
Today is the fourth day of the tournament.

180
00:07:53,570 --> 00:07:59,020
Nankatsu, aiming for their 3rd championship, wakes up on the day they will play Hanawa,

181
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:02,040
their second major rival after Azumaichi...

182
00:08:02,530 --> 00:08:04,750
Looks like it's going to be a hot day today.

183
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:11,630
Alright!

184
00:08:11,630 --> 00:08:19,060
Fight! Fight!

185
00:08:25,410 --> 00:08:29,320
No matter what, I have to find a way to play in the finals.

186
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:34,070
So guys, don't you dare lose until the finals.

187
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:35,250
Captain...

188
00:08:35,250 --> 00:08:36,700
Hyuga...

189
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:38,990
Hey, who told you you could take a break?

190
00:08:38,990 --> 00:08:41,170
Keep running!

191
00:08:41,170 --> 00:08:42,600
Yes!

192
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:51,300
Fight! Fight!

193
00:08:52,780 --> 00:08:57,680
Saitama World Stadium is quite fired up before the match.

194
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:01,850
Today's first match is the third round match between Nankatsu MS and Hanawa MS.

195
00:09:01,850 --> 00:09:04,620
Go Hanawa, Go!

196
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:07,840
Just for this match, Hanawa has brought more than double the cheer squad from Akita.

197
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:12,370
They are taking defeating the tournament favorite Nankatsu very seriously.

198
00:09:12,370 --> 00:09:14,610
This cheer.

199
00:09:14,610 --> 00:09:16,610
HANAWA MIDDLE SCHOOL
AKITA REPRESENTATIVE

200
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:16,610
Listen, guys!

201
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:20,370
At least in return for the cheer, don't come back without winning!

202
00:09:20,370 --> 00:09:21,370
Yes!

203
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:23,120
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA REPRESENTATIVE

204
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:25,210
Alright, guys. Don't forget yesterday's rhythm.

205
00:09:25,210 --> 00:09:26,910
Show everything you have today!

206
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:27,830
Okay, coach!

207
00:09:32,070 --> 00:09:33,880
It's been a long time, Tsubasa.

208
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,730
Yes.

209
00:09:34,730 --> 00:09:36,590
It was the elementary school tournament, right?

210
00:09:36,590 --> 00:09:39,930
It really has been a long time. We've been waiting for this moment since that day.

211
00:09:39,930 --> 00:09:44,650
Unlike yesterday, we will show all our strength today.

212
00:09:44,650 --> 00:09:47,900
I'm sorry, but your undefeated winning streak ends today.

213
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:50,500
Hah, you'll see that in your dreams.

214
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:53,900
Your aerial football won't work on us.

215
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:57,590
You're living in a dream world as usual.

216
00:09:57,590 --> 00:10:00,180
Are you going to score on your own goal again, Mr. Monkey?

217
00:10:00,180 --> 00:10:01,660
What did you say?

218
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:04,870
I've changed, okay?

219
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:04,870
Still the same argument?

220
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:08,710
Both teams are coming onto the field.

221
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:12,250
The crowd is excited!

222
00:10:12,250 --> 00:10:13,590
Hanawa!

223
00:10:13,590 --> 00:10:15,760
Play to win, Hanawa!

224
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:18,260
We trust you, Nankatsu!

225
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:25,220
I'm counting on you for the photos.

226
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:28,410
Can he really do the dead leaf shot?

227
00:10:28,410 --> 00:10:31,530
Even if we're talking about Tsubasa, he's still a middle school student.

228
00:10:31,530 --> 00:10:35,050
On top of that, he barely even took a shot in the Nishigaoka match.

229
00:10:35,050 --> 00:10:36,960
I'm sure he'll do it today.

230
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,570
What?

231
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:39,820
Call it a reporter's sixth sense.

232
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:45,900
At the same time, at Bay Coast Stadium, the match between Toho Academy and Yoko MS from Gifu

233
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:50,790
is about to start.

234
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:53,960
Hyuga is not on the bench again today.

235
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:57,140
So we won't see his incredible shot.

236
00:10:57,140 --> 00:11:01,210
Maybe he really isn't feeling well, maybe he's injured.

237
00:11:01,210 --> 00:11:04,640
If they wanted to save him for the finals, they could keep him on the bench.

238
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:06,060
If that's the case...

239
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:08,310
Sorry to bother you,

240
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:09,600
KOJIRO HYUGA ON THE FIELD!!
INCREDIBLE EXPLOSIVE POWER IN HIS RIGHT LEG!
ARE THEY SAVING HIM FOR THE FINALS!?
THE DENT IN THE STADIUM WALL WAS MADE BY HYUGA'S SHOT!

241
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:11,600
but isn't this fabricated news?

242
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,600
KOJIRO HYUGA ON THE FIELD!!
INCREDIBLE EXPLOSIVE POWER IN HIS RIGHT LEG!

243
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:14,110
No, it was all completely true.

244
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,690
I saw it with my own eyes.

245
00:11:17,690 --> 00:11:21,710
It was a miraculous shot.

246
00:11:21,710 --> 00:11:25,280
It was twice as fast as a normal player's shot.

247
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:27,460
A dream-like shot.

248
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:37,170
This is the Wild Tiger Kojiro Hyuga's Tiger Shot!

249
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:42,020
Don't let your guard down just because you scored 8 goals yesterday.

250
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:43,440
Focus.

251
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,470
Okay, coach!

252
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:48,140
Even without Hyuga, we won't lose until the finals.

253
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:52,920
And if the coach says he won't play Hyuga in the final,

254
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:56,880
we will boycott the match!

255
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:05,000
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

256
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:10,750
The much-anticipated match between Nankatsu and Hanawa is about to start.

257
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:14,850
Let me introduce the starting 11 of both teams.

258
00:12:14,850 --> 00:12:16,000
First team, Hanawa.

259
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,020
Yoshikura in goal.

260
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:23,720
Koda, Takeda, Nakamura, and Murasawa in defense.

261
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:27,720
Shiota, Aimoto, and Tamai in midfield.

262
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:32,370
Ono and the Tachibana Twins with their acrobatic football,

263
00:12:32,370 --> 00:12:34,900
Masao and Kazuo Tachibana in forward.

264
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:38,650
Let's continue with Nankatsu's team.

265
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:41,690
Morisaki in goal.

266
00:12:41,690 --> 00:12:46,730
Nakazato, Oda, Takasugi, and Ishizaki in defense.

267
00:12:46,730 --> 00:12:52,100
Iwami, Izawa, and their captain Tsubasa Ozora in midfield.

268
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:55,460
Nagano, Kisugi, and Taki in forward.

269
00:13:01,970 --> 00:13:04,340
The match starts with Nankatsu's kickoff!

270
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:05,950
We trust you, Tsubasa!

271
00:13:05,950 --> 00:13:06,590
Of course!

272
00:13:06,590 --> 00:13:10,400
Tsubasa didn't show himself much in the second match,

273
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:13,770
but as playmaker, he's very important for this match.

274
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:16,080
It wouldn't be fun any other way!

275
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,400
Come on, let's take care of Tsubasa!

276
00:13:18,330 --> 00:13:20,690
So you're coming already, huh, Tachibana Twins?

277
00:13:20,690 --> 00:13:29,700
Three years ago, as Nankatsu's golden duo, Tsubasa and Misaki, you stopped our attacks.

278
00:13:30,460 --> 00:13:33,700
But Nankatsu no longer has Misaki.

279
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:38,160
In other words, now we are the strongest duo!

280
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,450
Let's go, Tsubasa!

281
00:13:39,450 --> 00:13:43,010
You can't stop us alone!

282
00:13:43,610 --> 00:13:46,130
You're right, Misaki is no longer here.

283
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:49,970
Even without Misaki, I still have...

284
00:13:50,710 --> 00:13:54,480
Tsubasa passes instead of dribbling!

285
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,180
What?!

286
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:59,940
I still have my friends!

287
00:14:00,450 --> 00:14:02,020
Come on, guys!

288
00:14:02,020 --> 00:14:03,240
Go!

289
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:06,410
Nankatsu is advancing into Hanawa's half!

290
00:14:06,410 --> 00:14:07,420
What?!

291
00:14:08,950 --> 00:14:09,700
Iwami!

292
00:14:09,700 --> 00:14:10,910
Izawa!

293
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:15,700
The ball goes to Nankatsu's midfield, to Izawa, led by Tsubasa.

294
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:16,210
To you!

295
00:14:16,210 --> 00:14:18,330
Izawa quickly sends the ball to the wings.

296
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:21,430
Taki is waiting there, as usual.

297
00:14:21,430 --> 00:14:23,590
Will he make his own move?

298
00:14:23,590 --> 00:14:25,840
No, he cuts inside!

299
00:14:26,220 --> 00:14:27,300
I won't allow it!

300
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:29,430
What?!

301
00:14:29,430 --> 00:14:33,050
Hanawa's defense tries to stop him, but Taki passes to Kisugi!

302
00:14:33,050 --> 00:14:34,520
That was great!

303
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:38,520
Kisugi dribbles without slowing down.

304
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:39,270
Hey!

305
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:41,690
Hanawa's defense is stunned!

306
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:41,690
What are you doing?! Go after them!

307
00:14:42,420 --> 00:14:43,150
Here!

308
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:45,030
Kisugi crosses.

309
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:47,740
Tsubasa runs to the ball's path.

310
00:14:47,740 --> 00:14:50,870
Fools! Don't leave Tsubasa unmarked!

311
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:51,450
Taki!

312
00:14:51,450 --> 00:14:54,450
Tsubasa sends a nice pass in front of the goal!

313
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:54,450
Nice pass!

314
00:14:54,450 --> 00:14:56,950
Taki inside the penalty area!

315
00:14:56,950 --> 00:14:58,250
Eat this!

316
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:04,060
The ball is in the net!

317
00:15:04,060 --> 00:15:05,270
I did it!

318
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:07,550
Nankatsu shows incredible teamwork!

319
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:10,050
Just one minute after the match started...

320
00:15:10,050 --> 00:15:14,010
They scored an incredible goal, taking advantage of Hanawa's opening!

321
00:15:14,010 --> 00:15:15,600
We did it!

322
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:18,180
Nice, you're doing great, kids.

323
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:19,940
You're amazing, Taki!

324
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:21,480
You're amazing, Taki!

325
00:15:22,370 --> 00:15:24,100
No way...

326
00:15:24,100 --> 00:15:25,650
Damn it!

327
00:15:25,650 --> 00:15:29,340
Alright, it's our turn with our aerial football!

328
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:30,460
Let's go, Kazuo!

329
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:31,410
Yeah!

330
00:15:34,330 --> 00:15:35,080
Masao!

331
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,240
I'm here!

332
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,740
Come with me, Masao!

333
00:15:37,740 --> 00:15:40,310
It's Hanawa's turn to attack.

334
00:15:40,310 --> 00:15:43,000
The Tachibana twins are advancing with the ball.

335
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,790
Takasugi, Ishizaki! Mark them both!

336
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:46,630
Of course!

337
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:48,460
It won't go as planned.

338
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:49,460
Before you can start...

339
00:15:49,460 --> 00:15:51,840
Our aerial football has begun!

340
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:57,140
Masao Tachibana tossed the ball into the air in front of the goal.

341
00:15:57,140 --> 00:16:01,140
The Tachibana Twins' aerial football move!

342
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:03,650
It's coming! That shot from back then...

343
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,030
I'm coming, Masao!

344
00:16:08,030 --> 00:16:11,030
Come on, let's tie the score!

345
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:12,450
I won't allow it!

346
00:16:12,450 --> 00:16:15,730
Are you saying our move won't work?!

347
00:16:15,730 --> 00:16:16,570
What?!

348
00:16:16,570 --> 00:16:20,750
How can you say that after seeing what we can do?

349
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:23,120
I said it won't work!

350
00:16:24,370 --> 00:16:27,000
Kazuo Tachibana lost his balance!

351
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,840
He couldn't jump as he wanted!

352
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:36,090
Hanawa's aerial football was shattered!

353
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:40,640
Nice! Good job, Ishizaki!

354
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,330
You're amazing, Ishizaki!

355
00:16:42,330 --> 00:16:46,360
You did a good job with that brainless head of yours! You smart kid!

356
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:51,900
I've been in your debt since that own goal I scored.

357
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:55,300
Did you see that?

358
00:16:55,300 --> 00:17:01,290
I always thought Ishizaki couldn't be relied on, but sometimes he can do the right thing at the right time.

359
00:17:01,290 --> 00:17:03,690
I didn't think they would stop us like that.

360
00:17:03,690 --> 00:17:04,670
Yes.

361
00:17:04,670 --> 00:17:06,870
Great. Keep this rhythm!

362
00:17:06,870 --> 00:17:08,170
Guys, let's score another goal!

363
00:17:08,660 --> 00:17:10,090
Let's go!

364
00:17:10,090 --> 00:17:11,210
Here it comes!

365
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:14,640
This match was expected to be very competitive,

366
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:18,670
but everything is happening under Nankatsu's control.

367
00:17:18,670 --> 00:17:24,150
Hanawa's defense is bewildered by Nankatsu's non-stop attacks.

368
00:17:24,150 --> 00:17:25,230
Damn it!

369
00:17:26,590 --> 00:17:31,230
Even if they make a surprise attack, Hanawa's Tachibana Twins won't be very effective against Nankatsu.

370
00:17:31,230 --> 00:17:36,740
They have nice moves, but it's surprisingly easy to block their moves.

371
00:17:36,740 --> 00:17:40,280
Our combination doesn't have such a weakness.

372
00:17:41,930 --> 00:17:45,170
Nankatsu is advancing for a second goal.

373
00:17:45,170 --> 00:17:46,750
I'm releasing this to you.

374
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:50,880
Tsubasa is nothing like his passive self from yesterday.

375
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:54,880
He's showing his talent under all conditions.

376
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:57,240
Tsubasa is playing well today!

377
00:17:57,240 --> 00:18:01,590
Resting him in the second match seems to have worked.

378
00:18:01,590 --> 00:18:04,020
This is a different team play, I guess.

379
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:05,770
Here it comes!

380
00:18:05,770 --> 00:18:09,310
The ball is with Tsubasa, who is at the peak of his form!

381
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:12,480
I'm coming!

382
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:15,440
Too fast!

383
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:18,160
Tsubasa slipped through his opponents!

384
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,450
You did it, Tsubasa!

385
00:18:19,450 --> 00:18:20,570
Damn it!

386
00:18:20,570 --> 00:18:24,540
Murasawa from defense started chasing him without hesitation.

387
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:34,190
But Tsubasa quickly passed!

388
00:18:34,190 --> 00:18:35,210
What?!

389
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:38,130
The forward center Kisugi received the ball!

390
00:18:38,130 --> 00:18:43,390
I'm striker Teppei Kisugi! It'd be a shame if I didn't score!

391
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:47,910
And goal!

392
00:18:47,910 --> 00:18:50,440
Nankatsu scores their second goal in the first half!

393
00:18:52,190 --> 00:18:53,770
Nice shot, Kisugi!

394
00:18:53,770 --> 00:18:54,260
You did it!

395
00:18:54,260 --> 00:18:55,050
We did it!

396
00:18:55,050 --> 00:18:56,690
Now we're leading by two!

397
00:18:56,690 --> 00:18:57,890
Ha...

398
00:18:57,890 --> 00:18:59,110
Second goal...

399
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:01,580
Hanawa conceded two goals in this short time.

400
00:19:01,580 --> 00:19:04,890
I'm sure they didn't foresee this.

401
00:19:04,890 --> 00:19:06,780
We have to do it, Kazuo.

402
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:08,120
Yes, big brother.

403
00:19:08,550 --> 00:19:10,850
We have no choice but to show it.

404
00:19:10,850 --> 00:19:13,570
Our new aerial football move.

405
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:16,340
Guys!

406
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:18,870
Sorry, Masao, Kazuo.

407
00:19:18,870 --> 00:19:20,470
We can't change the past.

408
00:19:20,470 --> 00:19:22,970
We trust you, Ono.

409
00:19:23,550 --> 00:19:25,240
Cross it into the penalty area.

410
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:27,240
So you're going to do it.

411
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:27,970
Yes.

412
00:19:27,970 --> 00:19:29,730
Is there a problem?

413
00:19:29,730 --> 00:19:30,690
What about your legs?

414
00:19:31,810 --> 00:19:34,370
We have to risk our legs.

415
00:19:34,370 --> 00:19:37,940
We need to score in this half.

416
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:41,520
The match will restart with Hanawa's kickoff.

417
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:45,260
Nankatsu's two goals were quite devastating.

418
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:49,200
We hope they attack like they did before and change the momentum.

419
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:52,570
Come at us however you want!

420
00:19:52,570 --> 00:19:56,090
As long as I'm here, I won't let you score.

421
00:19:56,090 --> 00:19:57,840
We will score the third goal.

422
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,090
What are you planning?

423
00:20:04,020 --> 00:20:05,350
The match continues.

424
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:06,850
Let's go!

425
00:20:06,850 --> 00:20:07,850
Huh?

426
00:20:08,710 --> 00:20:13,270
As soon as the whistle blew, the Tachibana Twins started running without the ball towards Nankatsu's goal.

427
00:20:13,270 --> 00:20:17,190
Ono gets the ball and starts running down the wing.

428
00:20:17,930 --> 00:20:18,860
Take this!

429
00:20:18,860 --> 00:20:21,610
He quickly sends a high cross into the penalty area!

430
00:20:24,610 --> 00:20:27,190
Do you think coming together changes anything?

431
00:20:27,190 --> 00:20:28,870
I'll throw off your balance again.

432
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,040
Kazuo, now!

433
00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:31,660
Of course!

434
00:20:34,370 --> 00:20:35,450
What?!

435
00:20:35,450 --> 00:20:37,880
What on earth is this?

436
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:41,630
Masao Tachibana is sliding on his back on the ground!

437
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:44,380
What does this mean?

438
00:20:44,380 --> 00:20:45,890
I'm coming, Masao!

439
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,050
Okay!

440
00:20:48,810 --> 00:20:50,810
This...!

441
00:20:51,850 --> 00:20:59,690
This is our new aerial football move, Skylab Hurricane!

442
00:20:59,690 --> 00:21:11,180
Oh my God! The Tachibana Twins locked their legs and jumped into the air!

443
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:18,210
Go!

444
00:21:18,210 --> 00:21:19,040
Morisaki!

445
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:20,210
Yes!

446
00:21:20,210 --> 00:21:22,660
Goal!

447
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:26,940
A mind-blowing move from the Tachibana Twins...

448
00:21:26,940 --> 00:21:28,720
This...!

449
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:32,140
This is the pinnacle of acrobatic football!

450
00:21:32,140 --> 00:21:38,230
A brand-new Skylab Hurricane move from Hanawa's Tachibana Twins!

451
00:21:39,730 --> 00:21:41,930
Finally!

452
00:21:41,930 --> 00:21:43,740
The match is just beginning!

453
00:21:43,740 --> 00:21:47,160
You did it, Masao, Kazuo!

454
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:54,240
What was that?

455
00:21:54,240 --> 00:21:55,830
Oh...

456
00:21:57,830 --> 00:22:00,180
Hah! Did you see that, Nankatsu?

457
00:22:00,180 --> 00:22:03,730
This is our new technique, Skylab Hurricane!

458
00:22:03,730 --> 00:22:04,840
We got our revenge!

459
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,650
The match is just starting now!

460
00:22:07,590 --> 00:22:10,110
What an incredible technique...

461
00:22:10,110 --> 00:22:12,970
Skylab Hurricane...

